# L §4.4 A movement takes a day, L §5.14 (tally 2.3, #247; review of G1, B1): the window twin of
# L5_14_hole_day_decision_in_binding: the decision is a hole day naming dd, and a member of the binding.
=== m.tally
model d1
  tally 2
  on 2026-04-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source card "invented"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind sweeps: event certain
  leg cash: PLN
place sav: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input pay: money PLN
input dd: date
move sweep: sweeps
  on dd
  reads sav
  leg cash from sav to world amount min(bal(sav), pay)
version v_card
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  pay = 100.00 PLN "c"
  dd = window(2026-05-04, 2026-05-06) "c"
  opening[sav] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "c"
ask n: count(t in sweeps over 2026-05)
ask n_p4: count(t in sweeps over 2026-05) with dd = 2026-05-04
ask n_p6: count(t in sweeps over 2026-05) with dd = 2026-05-06
ask s: sum(t.cash.amount for t in sweeps over 2026-05)
ask s_p5: sum(t.cash.amount for t in sweeps over 2026-05) with dd = 2026-05-05
=== expect
n: ?"date within window(2026-05-04, 2026-05-06) not precise enough for the day of sweep" (dd)
  unknown day: dd
  cut 2026-04-20
n_p4: 1
  pinned: dd = 2026-05-04
  cut 2026-04-20
n_p6: 1
  pinned: dd = 2026-05-06
  cut 2026-04-20
s: ?"date within window(2026-05-04, 2026-05-06) not precise enough for the day of sweep" (dd)
  unknown day: dd
  cut 2026-04-20
s_p5: 100.00 PLN
  pinned: dd = 2026-05-05
  cut 2026-04-20
